      "name": "Front nose cap",
      "features included": [
        "low tapered front termination",
        "rounded leading surface",
        "upper-to-lower shell transition"
      ],
      "function intent": "Closes the low front end of the housing and provides a smooth leading profile near the control-wheel end.",
      "physical behavior": "The curved cap redirects local impact and handling loads into the upper deck, side flanks, and underside while avoiding a sharp leading edge.",
      "geometry": "A shallow, transversely curved B-spline end patch concentrated near the positive longitudinal extremity.",
      "location": "Low front end of the housing at approximately z=69 to 78 mm.",
