      "features included": [
        "right sidewall",
        "perimeter support rail",
        "ergonomic side contour"
      ],
      "function intent": "Closes and stiffens the right side of the housing and provides the opposing grip surface.",
      "physical behavior": "Transfers upper-deck loads into the lower body and resists lateral compression, torsion, and local impacts through its deep curved section.",
      "geometry": "One elongated freeform B-spline patch approximately mirroring the left flank.",
      "location": "Positive-x side of the main housing.",
